  "title": "Digiday Names Taboola a ‘Top Tech Provider’ on its 2026 Top Workplaces List",
  "summary": "New York, NY – Taboola (Nasdaq: TBLA), a global leader in delivering performance at scale for advertisers, today announced that it has been named a ‘Top Tech Provider’ on Digiday’s 2026 Top Workplaces list. What: Each year, the Top Workplaces list honors the companies raising the bar across media, marketing, and technology. This year’s honorees […]",
